#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:167
#: 68dc7ad79a8d431ab062f0b3c4c5d837
msgid "Connecting a GPS/Compass module"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/common-kakuteh7wing.rst:169
#: 4c5ca72764844444ad53da72ea1886e0
msgid "This board does not include a GPS or compass so an :ref:`external GPS/compass <common-positioning-landing-page>` should be connected to the GPS/Compass in order for autonomous modes to function. A JST-GH connector for GPS/Compass is provided."
